sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Den as Treating Dentist
    participant MVC as DentistMedicalRecordController
    participant API as MedicalRecordController / AppointmentsController
    participant Svc as MedicalRecordService / AppointmentService
    participant DB as SQL Server

    Den->>MVC: POST /Dentist/Appointments/{id}/Start
    MVC->>API: POST /api/dentist/appointments/{id}/start
    API->>Svc: DentistStartAppointmentAsync(id, dentistUserId)
    Svc->>DB: Verify AssignedDentistUserId == dentistUserId & Status == 'CheckedIn'
    Svc->>DB: UPDATE Appointments SET Status='InProgress'
    Svc->>DB: UPDATE AppointmentServices SET Status='InService', ActualStart=SYSDATETIME()

    Den->>MVC: POST /Dentist/MedicalRecords/CreateEntry (Complaint, Diagnosis, Tooth Conditions)
    MVC->>API: POST /api/medical-records/entry
    API->>Svc: CreateClinicalEntryAsync(dentistUserId, request)
    Svc->>DB: Ensure DentalMedicalRecords exists for PatientUserId
    Svc->>DB: INSERT ClinicalEntries (ChiefComplaint, ExaminationNotes, Diagnosis, TreatmentSummary)
    Svc->>DB: UPSERT OdontogramEntries (ToothNumber 11..48, SurfaceCode, ConditionCode)
    DB-->>MVC: Entry & 32-Tooth FDI Odontogram Saved

    Den->>MVC: Complete Consultation
    MVC->>API: POST /api/dentist/appointments/{id}/complete
    API->>Svc: DentistCompleteAppointmentAsync(id, dentistUserId)
    Svc->>DB: Verify ClinicalEntries exists & no pending Diagnostics/Tasks
    Svc->>DB: UPDATE AppointmentServices SET Status='Completed', ActualEnd=SYSDATETIME()
    Svc->>DB: UPDATE Appointments SET Status='Completed', CompletedAt=SYSDATETIME()
    DB-->>MVC: Consultation Completed